Players can [[Customization|customize]] three parts of their [[Roadside Shop|roadside shops]]: the [[Customization/Roadside_Shop#Awning|awning]], the [[Customization/Roadside_Shop#Crates|crates]] and the [[Customization/Roadside_Shop#Base|base]]. This lists available options.

There are 95 options overall, including the original three: 38 for awnings, 32 for crates and 25 for bases.

The star icon (★) denotes options which are part of a [[Customization/Style Book|style]].
